 uidelines:\n• Handle costume pieces with care while changing to preven
 t damage to delicate fabrics\n• Promptly notify Ballet Arkansas in the
  event of costume damage at the point of discovery\, no matter how signi
 ficant\n• Never throw costumes or accessories on the floor\, or hang c
 ostumes by their elastic straps\n• Refrain from sitting on the floor w
 hile in costume\n• Do not attempt to alter\, mend\, clean\, or launder
  any costume or accessory\n• Never apply stage make-up while in costum
 e and shall take great care to refrain from smudging make-up on costume 
 during its removal\n• Refrain from the use of spray perfume or cologne
  while in costume\n• Never wear any garment not assigned to cast membe
 r\n• Do not handle or consume food or beverage while in costume\, with
